{
  "schema": "mcp-tools-list-benign/sources/v1",
  "description": "Pinned sources for a benign corpus of MCP tool definitions: one reconstructed tools/list document per server, extracted statically from source at the pinned commit by scripts/mcp-tools-list/fetch-tools-list-corpus.py. No server code is installed, imported or run.",
  "inclusion_policy": [
    "Official reference servers (modelcontextprotocol/servers, and the archived reference servers) and vendor-maintained servers of widely used products (GitHub, Microsoft Playwright, Cloudflare, Supabase, Sentry, AWS Labs).",
    "Every tool a server source defines is included as the vendor wrote it, including tools that read files, run commands, execute code or fetch URLs: that is the population a tools/list scan meets in practice.",
    "Labels: all benign. A flag on any of these tools is counted as a false positive unless the measurement file argues otherwise per tool.",
    "Excluded: servers whose tool definitions are not in source (stripe/agent-toolkit proxies the remote mcp.stripe.com; makenotion/notion-mcp-server derives its tools from an OpenAPI document at runtime), and the archived git server (an older copy of the reference git server)."
  ],
  "repos": [
