      "redistribute": true,
      "note": "The playwright-mcp server is a thin wrapper: its tools are defined in microsoft/playwright (packages/playwright-core/src/tools/backend). This pin is the commit whose timestamp (2026-09-28T22:45:38Z = 1790635538000 ms) names the playwright build playwright-mcp pins (1.64.0-alpha-1790635538000)."
    },
    {
